Microsoft Azure ☁️

Azure = Microsoft's Cloud Computing Platform

Azure is similar to AWS and GCP. It provides cloud services for storage, computing, AI/ML, hosting, and networking.

===

Azure main services
1. Storage 💾

Used to store:

Files
Images
Videos
Datasets
Backups

Azure service: Azure Blob Storage

===

2. Computing 🖥️

Used to run:

Applications
Python programs
Virtual machines
AI/ML workloads

Azure services:

Azure Virtual Machines
Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)

===

3. AI & Machine Learning 🤖

Used to:

Train ML models
Deploy ML models
Build AI applications
Use AI APIs

Azure services:

Azure Machine Learning
Azure AI Services
Azure OpenAI Service

====

4. Hosting 🌐

Used to deploy websites and applications.

Azure services:

Azure App Service
Azure Functions

Example:

Your FastAPI / Flask App
          ↓
      Azure App Service
          ↓
       Deploy
          ↓
      Public URL
          ↓
         Users

===

. Networking 🌍

Used to connect users, applications, databases, and cloud services.

Azure services:

Azure Virtual Network (VNet)
Azure Load Balancer
Azure DNS

===

